---
import L2 from '../assets/screens/L2.png';
import P1 from '../assets/screens/P1.png';
import P3 from '../assets/screens/P3.png';
import CoverageTable from '../components/CoverageTable.astro';
import Figure from '../components/Figure.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
import { packs } from '../data/packs';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import styles from './solutions.module.css';
---

<BaseLayout title="Free heads-up GTO. Buy bigger games once." description="Every heads-up preflop solution is free, from 8bb to 200bb. Buy packs for 3- to 9-handed play once - never a subscription.">
  <PageHeader marker="Solutions" title="Start free. Keep what you buy." lede="The complete heads-up game is included forever. Add the exact multiway coverage you need with one-time packs." />

  <Section top="sm" bottom="lg" width="content" labelledby="free">
    <div class={styles['block']}>
      <h2 id="free">Every heads-up spot. $0.</h2>
      <p>Get the whole heads-up preflop game from day one: 8bb to 200bb, push/fold, ante, rake and straddle structures. Train it, import hands, node lock it and build from it - without a cap, trial or expiry.</p>
    </div>
    <div class={styles['figure']}><Figure src={P1} alt="Screenshot of the installed packs tab, listing six packs with their size on disk." caption="Six packs cover 3 to 6 handed, heads-up, push/fold, ante, rake and straddle, from 5 MB to 763 MB." priority /></div>
  </Section>

  <Section top="lg" bottom="lg" width="content" labelledby="packs">
    <div class={styles['block']}>
      <h2 id="packs">Buy coverage, not a subscription</h2>
      <p>Each pack gives you solved spots for a specific table size and structure. Core covers 3- to 6-handed play from 15bb to 100bb. Add rake, antes, straddles, push/fold or deeper stacks when that is the game you play. Pick the coverage that matches your table; keep it for good.</p>
    </div>
    <div class={styles['table']}><CoverageTable rows={packs} caption="Solved coverage by pack. Availability as of launch." /></div>
  </Section>

  <Section top="lg" bottom="lg" width="content" labelledby="after">
    <div class={styles['block']}>
      <h2 id="after">Yours after checkout</h2>
      <p>Buy a pack once. Keep it. The app keeps updating free, and your installed solutions do not vanish behind a monthly bill. New coverage arrives as a new pack; it is always your call.</p>
    </div>
    <div class={styles['figure']}><Figure src={P3} alt="Screenshot of the Settings dialog's Purchases section with the Restore purchases control." caption="One button re-checks what this account already bought, on a reinstall or a new device." /></div>
  </Section>

  <Section top="lg" bottom="lg" width="content" labelledby="sizes">
    <div class={styles['block']}>
      <h2 id="sizes">Big coverage needs real space</h2>
      <p>These are complete solves, so larger packs take more room. Heads-up is 7 MB. Core is 763 MB. A 9-handed 60bb cell is 1.64 GB - bigger than Google Play allows in one Android pack - so Android coverage stops at 40bb, while iPadOS and macOS offer 60bb and 100bb separately.</p>
    </div>
    <div class={styles['figure']}><Figure src={L2} alt="Screenshot of the solution library filtered to two-handed structures, listing every heads-up stack depth from 8bb to 200bb." caption="The Players filter narrows the full library down to every heads-up structure it holds." /></div>
  </Section>

  <Section top="lg" bottom="2xl" width="content" labelledby="cost">
    <div class={styles['block']}>
      <h2 id="cost">Stop renting your study tools</h2>
      <p>Cloud study tools charge every month and hold the hands you upload. Poker Assistant keeps your data on your device: the app and heads-up are free, and packs are one-time purchases. Pack prices will be announced at launch.</p>
    </div>
  </Section>
</BaseLayout>
